WEBVTT

00:40.248 --> 00:44.961
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:57.974 --> 00:58.808
She is nowhere to be found.

01:00.977 --> 01:03.188
- Bu-yeon's boat is the only one missing?
- Yes.

01:04.773 --> 01:08.151
Does that mean someone
purposely kidnapped the bride?

01:11.279 --> 01:12.614
Who would do such a thing?

01:15.950 --> 01:16.785
Let us go.

01:18.286 --> 01:19.120
Sure.

01:38.348 --> 01:40.141
I am very happy that you came.

01:47.524 --> 01:48.399
What are you doing?

01:48.483 --> 01:49.984
Are you not going to carry me?

01:51.444 --> 01:53.488
- Can you not walk?
- Of course, I can.

01:53.571 --> 01:55.240
But people will come looking for me.

01:55.323 --> 01:58.535
It would be much faster to cast a spell
and run with me in your arms.

01:58.618 --> 02:00.453
If that is what you are worried about,

02:02.956 --> 02:04.082
do not worry and just walk.

02:10.964 --> 02:12.715
You are the strongest man in Daeho.

02:12.799 --> 02:15.009
Carrying me would be
a piece of cake for you.

02:16.928 --> 02:18.972
I do not want to waste my energy.

02:19.055 --> 02:20.723
Besides, you do not look that light.

02:21.724 --> 02:23.393
That is because I am wearing layers.

02:23.935 --> 02:25.270
It is difficult to walk with this.

02:28.523 --> 02:29.524
Then…

02:30.984 --> 02:32.735
- take it off.
- Here?

02:32.819 --> 02:34.028
Yes, take it off.

02:36.406 --> 02:37.407
I mean…

02:37.490 --> 02:40.910
this does seem
like a pretty deserted place.

02:42.745 --> 02:46.040
I get that you are impatient,
but doing it here seems inappropriate.

02:47.000 --> 02:48.293
Do you not think so?

02:50.461 --> 02:53.214
After all, this is
our first night together.

02:54.924 --> 02:56.217
Unbelievable. Listen.

02:56.926 --> 02:58.970
I was telling you
to take off that impractical robe.

02:59.053 --> 03:00.054
Why in the world…

03:01.431 --> 03:03.641
- would I want to do anything here?
- Right?

03:03.725 --> 03:04.809
I apologize.

03:04.893 --> 03:08.104
I am just really anxious.
I must have gotten ahead of myself.

03:09.564 --> 03:10.690
Hey, wait.

03:10.773 --> 03:13.401
Do not worry.
I am only taking off this robe.

03:16.112 --> 03:19.616
Are you sure you were not locked up
because you hurt your head?

03:20.283 --> 03:21.367
No, but I was ill.

03:22.410 --> 03:24.370
I was on the verge of death,

03:25.288 --> 03:27.081
but my mother found me and treated me.

03:27.832 --> 03:29.000
Why were you ill?

03:29.083 --> 03:32.420
To be frank,
I do not know what it was myself.

03:33.046 --> 03:34.464
Once I regained consciousness,

03:35.506 --> 03:37.175
I was already a lot better.

03:39.218 --> 03:40.637
How could you not know?

03:40.720 --> 03:43.431
You may not remember anything
from when you were unconscious,

03:43.514 --> 03:45.099
but what about before that?

03:45.892 --> 03:47.977
Was it because you got hurt,
or was it an illness?

03:49.520 --> 03:50.480
You see,

03:51.648 --> 03:53.483
I remember nothing before Jinyowon.

03:54.108 --> 03:55.860
I lost all my memories when I was ill.

03:58.238 --> 04:00.073
My condition is the reason

04:00.907 --> 04:02.617
why my mother kept me a secret…

04:04.786 --> 04:05.745
and hidden from everyone.

04:20.176 --> 04:21.844
No one knows of Bu-yeon's existence.

04:21.928 --> 04:23.680
Who could have taken her?

04:25.098 --> 04:26.432
Park Dang-gu of Songrim

04:27.308 --> 04:29.102
knew about Jinyowon's wedding ceremony.

04:29.811 --> 04:31.771
Perhaps he thought it was my wedding

04:31.854 --> 04:34.899
and stole the boat carrying the bride,
hoping to ruin the ceremony.

04:42.573 --> 04:44.909
The person from Jinyowon getting married

04:44.993 --> 04:47.203
is Jin Bu-yeon, not Jin Cho-yeon?

04:48.079 --> 04:49.247
Yes.

04:49.330 --> 04:51.916
She and my Uncle Yun-o,
who came with me from Seoho Fortress,

04:52.000 --> 04:54.252
are having the wedding ceremony in secret.

04:56.587 --> 04:59.048
I am only telling you
because you will not stop crying.

05:03.386 --> 05:04.220
Here.

05:05.513 --> 05:06.347
Thank you.

05:12.395 --> 05:14.063
Thank goodness it is not Cho-yeon.

05:15.231 --> 05:16.065
But wait a minute.

05:17.483 --> 05:19.402
Jin Bu-yeon is actually alive?

05:20.528 --> 05:22.113
Have you met her?

05:22.196 --> 05:24.240
- What is she like?
- I have not met her yet.

05:25.074 --> 05:28.661
Uncle Yun-o said he would
introduce her to me after the wedding.

05:29.912 --> 05:31.247
I guess I will know once I meet her.

05:36.919 --> 05:39.255
I was told Jin Bu-yeon was blind,
but you are not.

05:39.339 --> 05:40.298
That is also strange.

05:41.132 --> 05:42.800
Apparently, I was when I was little,

05:42.884 --> 05:44.761
but my sight came back after I recovered.

05:45.636 --> 05:46.929
I remember none of that, though.

06:07.325 --> 06:08.701
- What?
- You do not have it.

06:11.329 --> 06:12.663
I do not have what?

06:13.331 --> 06:14.499
The blue mark of a soul shifter.

06:15.374 --> 06:18.419
The energy sometimes enters the eyes
and enables a blind person to see.

06:19.420 --> 06:20.713
But I guess that was not the case.

06:21.589 --> 06:23.216
I thought they were found
on the left shoulder.

06:24.050 --> 06:25.176
Some have them in their eyes?

06:25.760 --> 06:26.594
Yes.

06:27.595 --> 06:29.013
I have never heard of such a thing.

06:29.972 --> 06:31.390
I am the only one who has seen it.

06:32.767 --> 06:35.728
That makes sense since you are a mage
who hunts down soul shifters.

06:35.812 --> 06:37.855
You must have killed
the infamous soul shifter as well.

06:44.654 --> 06:46.614
What is it? Did you fail to catch her?

06:49.033 --> 06:50.618
- She died.
- "She died"?

06:52.328 --> 06:53.704
Was it not you who killed her?

06:57.834 --> 06:59.335
I guess not.

07:00.128 --> 07:02.046
Did you know her? Were you close?

07:02.130 --> 07:03.589
You ask too many questions.

07:05.091 --> 07:07.760
I told you my story,
so I just wanted to hear yours.

07:07.844 --> 07:09.804
I know I picked you
to be my husband on a whim,

07:10.471 --> 07:12.056
but I would like to get to know you.

07:12.140 --> 07:14.225
You could not stop praising me
when you wanted me,

07:14.934 --> 07:16.936
but are you getting picky
now that I am here?

07:17.019 --> 07:19.480
I just want to know more about you.
Is that so bad?

07:19.564 --> 07:22.942
So you can leave me
if you find me insufficient?

07:23.943 --> 07:25.236
I thought you wanted someone

07:25.319 --> 07:27.613
who could defy your mother
and help you escape.

07:28.906 --> 07:30.908
If it is a loving husband
you are looking for

07:30.992 --> 07:33.578
instead of a means to escape,
then let us say goodbye now.

07:34.537 --> 07:36.706
I will send you back on the boat
to where you were.

07:42.044 --> 07:43.129
No way.

07:43.212 --> 07:45.673
As long as you free me
from that sickening cell,

07:47.008 --> 07:48.718
I will stay with you no matter what.

07:49.760 --> 07:51.179
You can be a thug for all I care.

07:53.764 --> 07:54.932
Fortunately, I am not that bad.

07:55.516 --> 07:56.893
I will still be reasonable. Do not worry.

07:57.518 --> 07:58.352
But…

07:59.562 --> 08:00.730
Why did you come for me?

08:01.230 --> 08:03.149
You obviously are not smitten with me,

08:03.232 --> 08:05.026
and you do not seem to pity me either.

08:07.528 --> 08:10.448
What is it that you need me for?

08:16.829 --> 08:17.663
You told me that

08:18.372 --> 08:19.999
you could see the energy inside me.

08:21.375 --> 08:22.251
What you are seeing

08:23.127 --> 08:24.045
is the ice stone.

08:26.964 --> 08:28.549
Ice stone?

08:29.133 --> 08:31.052
Long ago, Jin Bu-yeon found the ice stone

08:31.135 --> 08:33.763
that was lying at the bottom
of Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

08:35.389 --> 08:37.058
- Me?
- You do not need to remember.

08:37.141 --> 08:39.185
I just need your great divine powers.

08:39.894 --> 08:40.937
That is why I need you.

08:49.403 --> 08:50.780
My divine powers?

09:17.890 --> 09:19.016
It is the ice stone.

09:19.725 --> 09:21.102
He possesses the ice stone.

10:44.977 --> 10:46.479
They say Jang Uk is

10:46.562 --> 10:48.814
always followed by wraiths and grotesques.

10:49.523 --> 10:53.402
That must be why every time I meet him,
it sends a shiver down my spine.

10:53.486 --> 10:56.739
Then do not listen to Master Lee
and stop visiting him.

10:57.990 --> 10:59.825
He still bothers me, though.

10:59.909 --> 11:02.078
I get curious
about how he is doing as well.

11:02.787 --> 11:05.748
Jang Uk cannot use that power
for his own personal use.

11:06.582 --> 11:08.084
If he ever does,

11:08.167 --> 11:10.211
Park Jin will have to give up his life.

11:10.294 --> 11:12.421
He gave his word to the royal family
and Unanimous Assembly

11:12.505 --> 11:14.590
as he stepped down
from the leader position.

11:16.384 --> 11:19.303
And I have you to thank
for helping me keep Jang Uk

11:20.805 --> 11:22.223
in the palm of my hand.

11:23.724 --> 11:25.726
I am grateful for your acknowledgment.

11:27.436 --> 11:29.814
Just think of Jang Uk as a tool

11:29.897 --> 11:32.358
that helps you utilize
the energy of the sky.

11:42.660 --> 11:43.744
Did Jin Mu tell you

11:44.286 --> 11:46.247
to think that of me
to make you feel better?

11:54.672 --> 11:55.506
Uncle Yun-o.

11:56.257 --> 11:58.467
Were you not supposed
to get married tonight?

11:59.969 --> 12:00.803
I could not.

12:00.886 --> 12:02.304
Someone stole my bride.

12:04.014 --> 12:06.434
Park Dang-gu,
the newly appointed leader of Songrim,

12:06.517 --> 12:10.104
thought I was marrying Jin Cho-yeon
and kidnapped the bride.

12:13.732 --> 12:14.567
I…

12:16.026 --> 12:17.653
did what?

12:22.700 --> 12:25.870
I am here to retrieve
what Park Dang-gu has stolen from me.

12:25.953 --> 12:28.372
Find and bring him here this instant.

12:28.456 --> 12:29.957
What exactly

12:30.040 --> 12:32.585
did our leader steal from Jinyowon?

12:33.461 --> 12:36.255
You cannot just come here
in the middle of the night

12:36.338 --> 12:38.132
and demand what you want.

12:38.215 --> 12:40.050
Have you no manners?

12:40.134 --> 12:42.428
If you do not cooperate,
I will find him myself.

12:44.138 --> 12:46.307
Search all of Songrim
and find Park Dang-gu.

12:46.390 --> 12:47.349
Lady Jin.

12:53.230 --> 12:54.273
Lord Dang-gu is here.

13:01.155 --> 13:03.782
Lady Jin, do not be mistaken.
It was not me.

13:04.617 --> 13:06.869
I did not kidnap the bride
on her way to the wedding.

13:07.453 --> 13:08.287
"Wedding"?

13:09.622 --> 13:10.498
"Bride"?

13:10.581 --> 13:12.500
You knew about Jinyowon's wedding ceremony

13:12.583 --> 13:14.335
and went around asking about it,
did you not?

13:16.545 --> 13:18.631
Yes, that I did.

13:21.008 --> 13:22.760
I thought it was for Young Lady Jin.

13:23.427 --> 13:25.513
Although I wanted to ruin the ceremony,

13:25.596 --> 13:26.972
I did not.

13:29.225 --> 13:30.976
Dang-gu was with me all night.

13:31.685 --> 13:32.811
He was not the person…

13:35.523 --> 13:36.815
who kidnapped Jin Bu-yeon.

13:41.779 --> 13:45.199
Are you saying you came here

13:45.282 --> 13:49.036
looking for your eldest daughter,
Jin Bu-yeon?

13:50.746 --> 13:53.457
My goodness, this is so confusing.

13:53.541 --> 13:55.376
What is this about Jin Bu-yeon?

13:55.459 --> 13:56.919
That girl is dead!

13:57.002 --> 13:57.836
Cho-yeon.

13:57.920 --> 13:59.338
Explain to me what is going on.

14:00.589 --> 14:02.591
Well, the thing is…

14:06.011 --> 14:07.429
My sister is alive.

14:08.347 --> 14:11.141
She has been living in Jinyowon
for the last three years.

14:11.225 --> 14:12.643
What? She is alive?

14:12.726 --> 14:15.771
Yes, that is right.
I came here looking for Bu-yeon.

14:16.605 --> 14:18.857
She disappeared today
during her wedding ceremony.

14:19.817 --> 14:23.070
I was too flustered
having lost my precious daughter.

14:23.696 --> 14:24.780
I apologize for the discourtesy.

14:25.406 --> 14:27.074
I will be off now.

14:46.594 --> 14:47.428
Jin Bu-yeon.

14:49.597 --> 14:50.681
So you are alive.

14:55.769 --> 14:57.771
Why was Young Lady Jin so angry?

14:57.855 --> 14:59.857
She probably felt embarrassed and upset

15:00.441 --> 15:02.067
when she found out it was not you.

15:03.777 --> 15:06.614
You thought she was getting married,
but all you did was drink.

15:06.697 --> 15:08.407
She has the right to feel angry.

15:10.993 --> 15:12.536
I am the leader of Songrim now.

15:12.620 --> 15:14.747
I can no longer do whatever I want,
so I held back.

15:15.539 --> 15:16.707
What would you have done?

15:20.377 --> 15:21.295
If I were you…

15:24.548 --> 15:25.466
I would have done it.

15:29.845 --> 15:32.139
Because now I know
how much I will regret it…

15:34.558 --> 15:36.226
if I decide to walk away.

15:37.144 --> 15:38.562
When I found out it was her,

15:39.438 --> 15:41.565
I should have stepped forward
and held onto her

15:43.108 --> 15:44.443
instead of stepping away.

15:47.446 --> 15:48.280
Dang-gu.

15:50.616 --> 15:52.368
The most tragic experience

15:53.327 --> 15:55.913
is to live your entire life
regretting what you could have done.

15:58.165 --> 15:59.458
Please do not live that way.

16:16.308 --> 16:18.268
Young Master, you are back.

16:18.352 --> 16:19.186
Yes.

16:21.814 --> 16:22.898
Go on inside.

16:32.324 --> 16:33.826
What a nice place.

16:33.909 --> 16:35.327
It looks larger than Jinyowon.

16:38.706 --> 16:39.540
What now?

16:40.124 --> 16:41.959
Are you calculating
how wealthy your husband must be?

16:42.543 --> 16:44.253
Jinyowon is extremely rich too.

16:45.504 --> 16:48.882
Marrying a girl from a rich family like me
will help you boost your wealth.

16:48.966 --> 16:50.342
Not interested.

16:50.426 --> 16:52.261
All I need is your great divine powers.

16:53.637 --> 16:57.766
What about other qualities?
I might have more to offer.

16:59.143 --> 16:59.977
No.

17:00.728 --> 17:03.313
That is the only reason I need you.

17:07.776 --> 17:10.029
But that is the one thing
I do not possess.

17:11.864 --> 17:14.324
Gosh, I should not have said
my powers were that great.

17:21.040 --> 17:23.751
Young Master Jang,
where in the world were you?

17:23.834 --> 17:24.835
Oh, hey…

17:27.379 --> 17:29.048
Who, may I ask, are you?

17:29.757 --> 17:31.216
- I am--
- My bride-to-be.

17:32.134 --> 17:34.136
Pardon? Your bride-to-be?

17:35.054 --> 17:35.888
It is so sudden--

17:35.971 --> 17:37.765
Maidservant Kim, I will explain later.

17:38.348 --> 17:40.976
Our guest is very exhausted right now.

17:41.060 --> 17:42.603
Could you prepare a room for her?

17:44.396 --> 17:46.148
Please, Maidservant Kim.

17:47.691 --> 17:48.525
Yes, Young Master.

17:48.609 --> 17:50.903
I will find a room for her to rest in.

17:57.451 --> 18:00.704
Maidservant Kim raised me
ever since I was a baby.

18:01.580 --> 18:04.583
She is very dear to me,
so please treat her with respect.

18:05.375 --> 18:08.212
She is kind at heart,
so she will make you feel at home.

18:08.295 --> 18:10.047
You asked a person that dear to you

18:11.256 --> 18:12.382
to look after me?

18:13.675 --> 18:14.927
- What about it?
- It is just…

18:15.010 --> 18:16.929
I thought you would give me a hard time

18:17.471 --> 18:19.139
for forcing you to take me with you.

18:19.723 --> 18:21.600
I did not expect you to be so hospitable.

18:22.684 --> 18:24.103
Who says I was forced?

18:26.230 --> 18:28.107
I know I was not the most welcoming,

18:29.108 --> 18:30.859
but I went there because I needed you.

18:31.944 --> 18:33.112
You are my betrothed now,

18:33.904 --> 18:35.114
so you should be treated accordingly.

18:35.906 --> 18:39.743
But people will be suspicious
about you bringing me here.

18:40.369 --> 18:41.578
Should we not be careful?

18:41.662 --> 18:42.496
I thought

18:43.205 --> 18:45.666
you came with me because you were fed up
with being locked up.

18:46.959 --> 18:48.293
There is nothing to be careful of.

18:48.877 --> 18:50.087
Just do as you wish.

18:50.796 --> 18:51.630
No one here

18:52.506 --> 18:54.383
will stop you from doing what you want.

18:56.802 --> 18:58.053
Thank you for saying that.

18:58.137 --> 19:00.055
I will try my best to feel at home.

19:03.225 --> 19:06.311
I will accept your hospitality.

19:09.064 --> 19:11.066
You will find this room
the most comfortable.

19:11.900 --> 19:14.570
I will quickly bring you some food.

19:25.455 --> 19:27.207
I hope it suits your palate.

19:27.291 --> 19:29.459
Let me know if you need anything.

19:30.127 --> 19:30.961
I will.

19:39.344 --> 19:42.097
When you are done bathing,
I will have clean clothes ready for you.

19:45.100 --> 19:47.060
I did not have time
to get you anything new,

19:47.728 --> 19:50.272
so I brought you clothes that
used to belong to Madam Do-hwa.

19:50.355 --> 19:51.523
It looks nice on you.

19:52.024 --> 19:54.067
It is not only pretty,
but it is also light and comfortable.

19:54.985 --> 19:55.819
By any chance,

19:55.903 --> 19:58.113
is it all right if I keep this?

20:00.908 --> 20:03.368
It is neither in trend nor is it new.

20:03.452 --> 20:05.621
But if you like it, go ahead.

20:06.705 --> 20:07.998
- Thank you.
- You are welcome.

20:14.463 --> 20:15.297
You see…

20:18.258 --> 20:21.053
I am acquainted with a lot of people.

20:22.512 --> 20:26.433
So I know every young lady
that lives in the capital.

20:26.516 --> 20:28.310
But I have never seen you before.

20:28.393 --> 20:30.646
I have never left my house.

20:30.729 --> 20:31.813
That is probably why.

20:31.897 --> 20:33.023
I see.

20:33.649 --> 20:36.068
Your parents must be very strict.

20:42.741 --> 20:45.369
Where are the young master's parents?

20:45.452 --> 20:46.662
Do they not live here?

20:47.913 --> 20:49.414
They both passed away.

20:50.499 --> 20:51.333
Did you not know?

20:54.336 --> 20:56.129
We only just met.

20:57.172 --> 20:58.131
By any chance,

20:58.924 --> 21:03.095
do you also not know
what happened to him three years ago?

21:07.057 --> 21:08.558
So you know nothing about him,

21:08.642 --> 21:11.311
yet you followed him here
just because he asked you to marry him?

21:11.937 --> 21:13.397
I was the one who asked.

21:14.356 --> 21:15.732
I asked him to marry me.

21:16.566 --> 21:17.734
It was me who asked.

21:17.818 --> 21:19.653
And he said yes to that?

21:21.071 --> 21:21.905
Yes.

21:23.907 --> 21:24.950
How strange.

21:26.118 --> 21:26.952
I never thought

21:27.577 --> 21:30.038
he would even consider
getting married again.

21:31.748 --> 21:32.958
This is hard to believe.

21:34.835 --> 21:36.211
I wonder what he is thinking.

21:48.849 --> 21:52.185
Jin Bu-yeon had divine powers
that were as powerful as Jin Seol-ran's.

21:52.728 --> 21:54.646
Do you wish to remove the ice stone?

21:55.897 --> 21:57.441
If you do that, you will die.

22:08.827 --> 22:09.911
Are you all right?

22:10.829 --> 22:12.873
What happened?
Why are you soaked in water?

22:25.594 --> 22:26.428
Look.

22:30.515 --> 22:31.683
Excuse me.

22:32.642 --> 22:33.852
Are you all right?

22:33.935 --> 22:34.853
Are you awake?

22:37.689 --> 22:38.523
Where am I?

22:39.441 --> 22:40.734
How did I end up here?

22:45.614 --> 22:47.741
I must find the ice stone.

22:54.664 --> 22:57.042
I was told I would find him in his study.

23:10.305 --> 23:11.681
What are you doing?

23:12.599 --> 23:13.767
Are you stealing that?

23:17.020 --> 23:17.854
I am sorry.

23:18.438 --> 23:21.691
I am just so used
to stealing food and drinks.

23:23.610 --> 23:24.653
Leave it here.

23:39.126 --> 23:40.293
What?

23:41.628 --> 23:43.338
You said it was all right
to do as I wished.

23:47.300 --> 23:49.177
I always stole alcohol and drank alone.

23:49.261 --> 23:52.013
Have a drink with me
to celebrate my escape.

24:24.754 --> 24:25.589
If you drink that,

24:27.716 --> 24:29.342
it means we are officially married.

24:30.635 --> 24:32.762
Let us think of it as a wedding drink.

24:35.432 --> 24:37.267
Go on. Drink up.

24:40.979 --> 24:41.980
A wedding drink?

24:57.913 --> 24:58.747
Drink up.

25:03.919 --> 25:05.378
Why are you not drinking it?

25:05.462 --> 25:07.505
There is no need to rush
our first night together.

25:07.589 --> 25:08.924
Take it slow. The night is young.

25:09.007 --> 25:11.009
Summer nights are shorter.
The sun will shine any time now.

25:11.092 --> 25:13.595
What does that have anything to do
with becoming a married couple?

25:14.262 --> 25:16.473
I prefer it when it is dark.

25:18.767 --> 25:20.644
It would be awkward to do it in daylight.

25:22.771 --> 25:25.398
You really have a way
of surprising me with your words.

25:27.234 --> 25:29.110
Drinking during the day is bad for you.

25:29.194 --> 25:31.780
I only drank stolen alcohol at night,
so go on.

25:33.490 --> 25:34.324
Drink up.

25:37.786 --> 25:38.620
Fine.

25:39.204 --> 25:40.747
I will drink as soon as I check something.

25:50.173 --> 25:51.299
This is our first night together.

25:51.925 --> 25:53.218
You said it makes you feel awkward.

26:03.853 --> 26:04.896
Here.

26:05.689 --> 26:07.482
You can turn off the last lantern.

26:07.565 --> 26:09.025
For your information,

26:09.109 --> 26:12.654
I received this as a gift from Jinyowon
for complicated reasons.

26:12.737 --> 26:14.906
They said it was some kind of a lantern

26:14.990 --> 26:16.116
that never turns off.

26:17.242 --> 26:19.911
Anyway, the light cannot be blown out.

26:20.495 --> 26:22.664
Since you are
a great priestess of Jinyowon,

26:23.331 --> 26:25.458
use your divine powers to turn it off.

26:27.002 --> 26:28.003
I am waiting.

27:00.452 --> 27:01.286
You cannot do it.

27:03.872 --> 27:06.708
Why can you not do it?
I thought you had great divine powers.

27:07.334 --> 27:08.710
Apparently, I lost my divine powers

27:10.587 --> 27:12.505
along with my memory.

27:15.633 --> 27:17.469
All I can do is see energy with my eyes.

27:22.265 --> 27:23.141
Nothing else.

27:23.224 --> 27:25.226
Then you are of no use to me.

27:32.817 --> 27:34.152
Go home at daybreak.

27:34.235 --> 27:35.570
Tell them you got lost.

27:35.653 --> 27:37.155
You said you escaped a few times.

27:39.366 --> 27:40.742
Do you know why I got caught

27:41.910 --> 27:43.370
every time I ran away?

27:54.714 --> 27:55.757
Because of this.

27:55.840 --> 27:57.801
They always used this to find me.

28:03.807 --> 28:06.643
The tracking thread found
the bride's boat.

28:17.028 --> 28:19.239
Follow the energy of the tracking thread,

28:20.073 --> 28:21.157
and we will find her.

28:23.910 --> 28:25.620
The thread is tightening around my wrist.

28:25.703 --> 28:27.705
That means they will be here soon.

28:32.502 --> 28:34.045
So this is how they find you.

28:35.422 --> 28:36.965
People from Jinyowon will come,

28:37.799 --> 28:39.926
and they will know it was you who took me.

28:40.510 --> 28:41.344
When they come…

28:43.388 --> 28:45.849
I will tell them that
we got married overnight.

28:47.434 --> 28:48.351
This means

28:49.602 --> 28:51.229
I cannot send you back quietly.

28:51.312 --> 28:53.106
This thread comes from Jinyowon,

28:53.815 --> 28:55.650
and no sword is strong enough to cut it.

28:58.069 --> 28:58.903
Jang Uk.

29:00.655 --> 29:01.906
I do not wish to go back.

29:03.950 --> 29:04.993
I like it here.

29:09.289 --> 29:10.206
And I like you too.

29:51.831 --> 29:53.500
I cannot feel the energy
of the tracking thread.

29:54.876 --> 29:56.002
The thread has been cut.

30:01.674 --> 30:02.509
There.

30:03.468 --> 30:04.344
I cut the thread.

30:05.470 --> 30:06.805
Now you can quietly return home.

30:12.477 --> 30:13.645
Leave once the sun rises.

30:24.239 --> 30:25.240
I will leave now.

30:25.323 --> 30:27.534
It will be more embarrassing
to be caught in broad daylight.

30:30.870 --> 30:32.121
I may have deceived you,

30:33.081 --> 30:34.415
but not everything was a lie.

30:35.375 --> 30:37.627
I do have great divine powers.

30:37.710 --> 30:40.046
And the person who treated me told me
that once I get my memory back,

30:41.965 --> 30:43.883
my divine powers will come back as well.

30:47.262 --> 30:48.471
I am sorry I lied to you.

30:50.181 --> 30:51.599
Thank you for your hospitality.

30:52.600 --> 30:53.518
When I get back,

30:54.894 --> 30:56.729
I will not mention your name.

30:58.565 --> 30:59.774
Bu-yeon has disappeared.

31:00.608 --> 31:01.693
Do you think

31:01.776 --> 31:04.821
she has regained her memories and powers?

31:06.531 --> 31:08.908
If she regained her memories,
she may have run away.

31:09.993 --> 31:11.536
After all, the soul inside that body

31:12.996 --> 31:14.163
belongs to Naksu.

31:14.247 --> 31:15.540
The body is Bu-yeon's.

31:15.623 --> 31:18.251
The blood of the eldest daughter
of the Jin family runs in that body.

31:18.334 --> 31:21.087
Is that the reason you confined her

31:21.170 --> 31:23.089
and tried to marry her off
to carry on the family line?

31:23.882 --> 31:27.427
What were you planning to do with her body
once she gave birth to a baby?

31:28.011 --> 31:29.178
Get rid of it once again?

31:30.054 --> 31:31.681
Did you forget what you promised me

31:31.764 --> 31:34.475
when you begged me to save her life
after you found her body

31:35.602 --> 31:38.062
at the bottom of Lake Gyeongcheondaeho?

31:46.613 --> 31:49.949
The body has petrified
without a single ounce of water left,

31:50.033 --> 31:51.576
yet she is still alive. How miraculous.

31:51.659 --> 31:53.369
3 YEARS AGO

31:53.453 --> 31:54.537
Please save her.

31:54.621 --> 31:57.624
She is my long-lost daughter.

31:57.707 --> 32:01.169
I always wondered why she never ran wild
even with Naksu's energy.

32:01.252 --> 32:04.422
I guess it was because the body
belonged to a Jinyowon priestess.

32:06.174 --> 32:09.385
Naksu did not take over this body
using the alchemy of souls.

32:09.469 --> 32:12.639
Her soul was actually locked up
inside this body.

32:12.722 --> 32:15.683
She called me "Mother."

32:15.767 --> 32:16.935
Bu-yeon's soul

32:17.685 --> 32:20.688
also remains inside this body.

32:24.984 --> 32:25.985
The choice is yours.

32:27.779 --> 32:29.155
The only way to keep this body alive

32:29.739 --> 32:32.784
is to use Naksu's energy
that remains inside the body.

32:33.368 --> 32:35.870
Bu-yeon's soul is clinging to that energy.

32:36.579 --> 32:39.540
In order to use Naksu's energy,
we must get rid of Bu-yeon's soul

32:39.624 --> 32:41.292
while leaving Naksu's.

32:43.294 --> 32:44.295
Are you asking me

32:45.505 --> 32:49.008
to choose Naksu's soul
over my own daughter's?

32:51.010 --> 32:52.762
That or let them both die.

32:53.888 --> 32:54.722
What will you do?

32:55.974 --> 32:58.601
Do you wish to keep the body alive
through Naksu's soul?

32:58.685 --> 33:01.270
Or will you keep your daughter's soul
and watch her die?

33:03.815 --> 33:05.400
I will respect your decision.

34:04.542 --> 34:06.919
She is recovering using Naksu's energy.

34:07.003 --> 34:10.048
As the energy flows in her face
and she starts looking human again,

34:10.131 --> 34:12.091
her features will
slowly resemble those of Naksu's.

34:13.593 --> 34:16.012
The body and soul must be one
for her not to run wild.

34:16.888 --> 34:19.682
Are you telling me to look at that face
and think of her as my daughter?

34:21.434 --> 34:22.894
You made your own choice.

34:22.977 --> 34:27.356
You decided to use all of Naksu's energy
to save your daughter's body.

34:29.859 --> 34:33.196
She has a new body now,
so her memory is gone.

34:33.780 --> 34:36.032
Naksu's soul may still remain,

34:36.699 --> 34:38.326
but she lost both her energy

34:39.786 --> 34:40.870
and memory.

35:04.435 --> 35:07.355
She remembers nothing,
which is why she thinks you are her mother

35:07.438 --> 35:10.066
and does not struggle to accept
that she is Jin Bu-yeon.

35:10.650 --> 35:13.069
She opens the doors to Jinyowon
and sees the energy of the world

35:13.152 --> 35:14.862
because my daughter's blood
runs inside her.

35:14.946 --> 35:17.031
But she has no other powers.

35:18.324 --> 35:19.367
My daughter

35:19.450 --> 35:23.830
used to handle relics inside Jinyowon
as if they were her toys.

35:25.706 --> 35:27.458
Does this mean she lost her divine powers?

35:27.542 --> 35:29.544
Bu-yeon's body has no divine powers,

35:29.627 --> 35:31.546
and Naksu's soul has no memory,

35:31.629 --> 35:33.923
so the body and soul do not conflict.

35:34.757 --> 35:36.259
If she regains her divine powers,

35:36.843 --> 35:39.053
Naksu's memory will likely follow.

35:40.346 --> 35:41.180
Can you bear that?

35:43.015 --> 35:44.725
I would rather have her stay that way

35:45.434 --> 35:47.854
than have Naksu's memory come back.

35:47.937 --> 35:49.981
Then are you going to keep her confined?

35:51.983 --> 35:53.442
That is my decision to make.

35:54.193 --> 35:57.155
And if I decide to kill her
because I can no longer stand it,

35:57.238 --> 35:58.197
then so be it.

35:59.448 --> 36:01.701
You promised to respect my decisions.

36:03.703 --> 36:05.329
Jang Uk loved her.

36:06.122 --> 36:09.167
If you tell him,
he will help you protect her.

36:09.250 --> 36:12.461
No. He was in love with Naksu.

36:15.590 --> 36:18.676
She will only live
as my daughter, Bu-yeon.

36:20.178 --> 36:23.389
I will not let him find out about her.

36:25.183 --> 36:30.646
Besides, Jang Uk does not know
what Naksu's real face even looks like.

36:32.273 --> 36:35.526
Even if the two ever do meet,

36:36.235 --> 36:40.615
they will not be able
to recognize each other.

36:45.286 --> 36:48.456
I have to live my life in agony
looking at that girl's face,

36:49.207 --> 36:52.293
so that is the price that must be paid.

36:57.381 --> 36:59.091
I respected your decision as a mother

36:59.175 --> 37:02.011
and did not tell anyone
about her existence.

37:02.595 --> 37:04.096
However, today…

37:05.890 --> 37:08.476
the entire world ended up
finding out about Bu-yeon.

37:10.269 --> 37:12.897
What is important is that I find her.

37:13.481 --> 37:16.901
She has escaped a few times before,
but I always managed to find her.

37:18.569 --> 37:19.403
This time…

37:21.781 --> 37:22.907
it will be no different.

37:35.753 --> 37:36.963
Goodbye, my lady.

38:00.945 --> 38:01.821
What is that smell?

38:03.447 --> 38:05.157
Is it the smell of water?

38:13.040 --> 38:13.874
What is that?

38:15.543 --> 38:17.211
I sense a strange kind of energy.

38:21.048 --> 38:22.174
Are you on patrol?

38:23.050 --> 38:23.926
Did something happen?

38:44.780 --> 38:46.949
Mister. Wake up.

39:12.016 --> 39:13.601
I am sure it came in here.

39:42.797 --> 39:44.965
Hey, wake up. Are you all right?

39:48.344 --> 39:49.470
It is not inside him.

39:51.222 --> 39:52.890
Where did that energy go?

40:15.037 --> 40:16.705
I know you are hiding in there.

40:17.832 --> 40:19.125
Why did you come here?

40:32.221 --> 40:33.264
This may be broken,

40:33.347 --> 40:35.141
but it is a Jinyowon relic
that still holds power.

40:36.016 --> 40:37.059
Eat this and go away.

41:40.706 --> 41:41.540
Young Master.

41:42.208 --> 41:44.418
Did something strange
enter the house again?

41:44.502 --> 41:46.003
Should I wake Maidservant Kim?

41:46.086 --> 41:47.421
I already took care of it.

41:47.505 --> 41:49.423
Just let her sleep.

41:52.009 --> 41:54.136
You will get cold tonight
because you came in contact with it.

41:54.762 --> 41:56.555
Drink some strong liquor
before going to bed.

41:56.639 --> 41:57.681
Yes, Young Master.

41:58.390 --> 42:01.977
She came to check up on me
and tried to help me.

42:03.062 --> 42:04.522
She will also be feeling cold.

42:04.605 --> 42:06.690
I will bring a brazier
and some strong liquor.

43:10.045 --> 43:11.088
If you drink that,

43:11.630 --> 43:13.257
it means we are officially married.

43:14.675 --> 43:16.885
Let us think of it as a wedding drink.

43:30.941 --> 43:32.943
She is of no use to me,
and yet she is a nuisance.

43:36.030 --> 43:37.865
Here is the portrait I received
before the wedding.

43:38.699 --> 43:39.992
Can you really find her?

43:40.075 --> 43:41.660
With the help
of Songrim's merchants' association,

43:41.744 --> 43:45.122
every person in Daeho
will get to see this portrait by today.

43:46.498 --> 43:50.085
I will help Young Lady Jin
find her sister.

43:52.171 --> 43:54.590
WHOEVER FINDS THIS LADY
WILL BE REWARDED GENEROUSLY

43:56.592 --> 43:58.927
She is Jin Bu-yeon,
the eldest daughter of Jinyowon.

43:59.887 --> 44:01.513
All the ladies at Jinyowon are beautiful.

44:01.597 --> 44:04.058
Is it true that
whoever finds her will be rewarded?

44:04.141 --> 44:05.684
Yes, it says it right there.

44:05.768 --> 44:07.936
Goodness, they are giving a reward.

44:10.272 --> 44:12.149
Does that mean Jin Bu-yeon is going to be

44:12.232 --> 44:13.984
the next leader of Jinyowon?

44:14.068 --> 44:15.110
Most likely.

44:15.694 --> 44:19.073
Ever since she was young,
she was known for her great divine powers.

44:19.156 --> 44:21.033
Lady Jin's divine powers have weakened,

44:21.116 --> 44:22.951
so many have been saying
the Jin family should no longer be

44:23.035 --> 44:24.536
in charge of the relics and artifacts.

44:25.871 --> 44:28.374
So this is good news for the Jin family.

44:29.041 --> 44:30.668
Are you saying the Seo family

44:31.335 --> 44:33.003
and the Jin family were
planning to become in-laws?

44:33.754 --> 44:34.588
Yes, Your Majesty.

44:35.339 --> 44:37.091
Yun-o, we are cousins.

44:37.174 --> 44:39.468
How could you not tell me
about the wedding?

44:40.094 --> 44:43.097
I cannot believe even my own family
would disrespect me like this

44:44.807 --> 44:46.058
because of how I look.

44:46.141 --> 44:47.643
No one in the family knows.

44:47.726 --> 44:50.104
Lady Jin insisted
the wedding be held in secret.

44:50.187 --> 44:51.522
Please do not be angry.

44:51.605 --> 44:54.274
Then I guess Lady Jin
also has no respect for me.

44:54.358 --> 44:57.611
Her dead husband is the reason
why I look like this.

44:59.738 --> 45:00.572
Wait a minute.

45:01.740 --> 45:03.367
You were going to marry into the family

45:04.576 --> 45:06.286
that did this to me?

45:07.830 --> 45:08.664
Forgive me.

45:08.747 --> 45:10.833
The marriage has been canceled.
Please calm down.

45:13.419 --> 45:14.378
Not a single person

45:15.754 --> 45:17.214
acknowledges the pain I feel.

45:17.798 --> 45:19.174
Could you please

45:19.258 --> 45:21.677
help me find a way
to get out of this body?

45:21.760 --> 45:23.762
There is no other way.

45:26.974 --> 45:28.267
I cannot let you shift souls

45:29.184 --> 45:30.602
just because you are the Queen.

45:32.271 --> 45:35.899
Anyway, now that we know
that Jinyowon's heir is alive and well,

45:37.276 --> 45:40.571
they can appoint her as the official heir
at the Unanimous Assembly.

45:49.413 --> 45:50.247
Are you telling me

45:51.790 --> 45:54.334
that this is the face of Jin Bu-yeon?

45:54.418 --> 45:55.252
Yes.

45:55.794 --> 45:58.714
Even Songrim is helping them find her,
so it must be true.

46:08.599 --> 46:10.225
This is Naksu's face.

46:11.310 --> 46:14.229
I do not know about anyone else,
but her face is one I cannot forget.

46:14.313 --> 46:15.230
So…

46:16.315 --> 46:18.984
how can she be Jin Bu-yeon?

46:20.152 --> 46:21.278
I should look into it.

46:26.783 --> 46:28.243
She is Jin Bu-yeon?

46:29.620 --> 46:30.454
That is not her.

46:31.413 --> 46:32.831
Jin Bu-yeon is Mu-deok.

46:38.212 --> 46:39.963
You must keep your body warm.

46:43.342 --> 46:46.136
Mr. Lee told me what happened last night.

46:46.220 --> 46:47.596
Thank goodness you are all right.

46:50.140 --> 46:51.683
I am sorry for worrying you.

46:53.143 --> 46:53.977
By the way,

46:54.978 --> 46:58.065
I heard you were
going to leave last night.

47:00.025 --> 47:02.903
Did Young Master Jang not say anything?

47:02.986 --> 47:05.155
He stayed by your side all night.

47:05.239 --> 47:06.865
Then he told me

47:06.949 --> 47:09.868
to give you some medicine for the chills
and just left.

47:09.952 --> 47:12.829
I am about to go to Sejukwon
to get some medicine for you.

47:12.913 --> 47:13.747
Maidservant Kim.

47:13.830 --> 47:16.208
How many days' worth did he ask for?

47:16.291 --> 47:18.168
He asked for three days' worth.

47:19.169 --> 47:20.087
Three days' worth?

47:23.048 --> 47:27.469
Then I guess I will be staying here
for at least three days.

47:34.518 --> 47:35.352
I bet you were

47:36.562 --> 47:37.646
awfully startled last night.

47:38.564 --> 47:42.109
Young Master Jang is
always surrounded by wicked things…

47:44.069 --> 47:46.238
which is why he is never able
to sleep properly.

47:46.321 --> 47:47.823
Why does that happen to him?

47:49.283 --> 47:52.536
It is because of
the great power within him.

47:54.621 --> 47:56.665
They are drawn to it
like moths to a flame.

47:59.293 --> 48:02.421
Did he need my divine powers
to get rid of that?

48:03.672 --> 48:06.049
He asked if I could
take out the ice stone.

48:07.342 --> 48:08.677
Will he find peace

48:09.595 --> 48:10.721
if that gets taken out?

48:49.009 --> 48:49.843
My lord.

48:51.053 --> 48:52.554
What are you doing today?

48:54.014 --> 48:55.223
They are red beans.

48:55.307 --> 48:56.433
Are you making red bean porridge?

48:57.684 --> 49:01.188
I am going to make meju with red beans.

49:02.272 --> 49:04.733
You are going to make meju
with red beans, not soybeans?

49:04.816 --> 49:07.235
"Making meju with red beans"
is an expression

49:07.319 --> 49:09.821
that people use
to describe a lie or bluff.

49:09.905 --> 49:12.157
But if I actually make meju
with red beans,

49:12.240 --> 49:16.203
then that expression will no longer exist.

49:17.120 --> 49:20.248
Everyone thinks this is impossible,
and I will be the first

49:21.541 --> 49:22.918
to prove them wrong.

49:26.296 --> 49:28.548
I am going to challenge myself.

49:28.632 --> 49:29.591
I bet you will lose.

49:30.175 --> 49:31.385
Meju is made with soybeans.

49:31.468 --> 49:33.178
- Red beans might work.
- Soybeans.

49:33.261 --> 49:34.179
- Red beans.
- Soy.

49:34.262 --> 49:35.138
- Red.
- Soy.

49:35.222 --> 49:36.515
- Soybeans.
- Red beans.

49:36.598 --> 49:37.766
- Red beans.
- Soybeans.

49:37.849 --> 49:38.934
- Red.
- Soy.

49:39.017 --> 49:39.976
- Red beans.
- Red…

49:40.060 --> 49:41.311
- Soy…
- Soy, red…

49:45.899 --> 49:50.153
You and I really do click well.

49:50.904 --> 49:51.738
Goodness.

49:52.531 --> 49:56.493
Even if you do make meju with red beans,
I will not even be that shocked.

49:57.244 --> 49:59.830
Something even more shocking
happened last night.

49:59.913 --> 50:00.997
What?

50:01.081 --> 50:03.083
Young Master Jang

50:03.166 --> 50:05.627
suddenly brought a lady home,
saying he will marry her.

50:06.837 --> 50:09.548
Uk wants to marry someone?

50:09.631 --> 50:12.300
This is more shocking
than what you are about to do, right?

50:13.719 --> 50:16.221
Uk is still not over that girl, right?

50:16.304 --> 50:17.305
Of course not.

50:17.389 --> 50:18.390
She is still…

50:21.184 --> 50:22.269
in his heart.

50:24.938 --> 50:25.772
My lord.

50:27.065 --> 50:29.151
I really do hope you succeed

50:29.234 --> 50:30.944
in making meju with red beans.

50:32.487 --> 50:34.656
Show me that impossible things
sometimes do happen.

50:36.116 --> 50:39.369
Uk brought someone home
saying he will marry her?

50:46.752 --> 50:48.128
Three days of taking medicine.

50:48.211 --> 50:50.547
A man and a woman
living together for three days?

50:51.381 --> 50:52.632
That is pretty much a married couple.

50:55.010 --> 50:56.094
There is still hope.

51:01.725 --> 51:02.768
Who are you?

51:02.851 --> 51:05.228
I am Young Master Jang's physician.

51:05.312 --> 51:07.856
I came because I heard Maidservant Kim
dropped by for some medicine.

51:09.107 --> 51:11.109
I guess he sent you to take care of me,

51:11.193 --> 51:13.028
although it was not necessary.

51:14.654 --> 51:16.948
Who exactly are you?

51:17.032 --> 51:18.116
Young Lady Heo.

51:18.200 --> 51:21.203
She looks exactly like the lady
that Lord Dang-gu

51:21.286 --> 51:22.996
and Young Master Seo Yul are looking for.

51:24.956 --> 51:25.791
You are right.

51:25.874 --> 51:28.460
Is your name Jin Bu-yeon?

51:28.543 --> 51:29.795
How do you know my name?

51:30.462 --> 51:32.172
No one knows who I am.

51:32.255 --> 51:33.590
What are you talking about?

51:33.673 --> 51:36.051
Your face is all over the capital.

51:36.134 --> 51:37.511
Everyone is looking for you.

51:37.594 --> 51:39.179
What are you doing
at Young Master Jang's place?

51:39.262 --> 51:41.515
- You should get out of here.
- Sun-i.

51:43.183 --> 51:46.353
Everyone knows about me,
and people are looking for me?

51:47.020 --> 51:48.730
Mother would never do that.

51:49.523 --> 51:51.316
Then who is looking for me?

51:52.609 --> 51:54.653
Are those your clothes?

51:54.736 --> 51:56.112
Is that not a wedding dress?

51:56.196 --> 51:58.365
Did you say a man named Seo Yul
is looking for me?

51:58.448 --> 51:59.407
Pardon?

51:59.491 --> 52:00.492
Yes.

52:00.575 --> 52:02.160
A man from the Seo family
at Seoho Fortress?

52:02.244 --> 52:04.454
The man who lacks nothing? Is that him?

52:04.538 --> 52:05.413
Yes, pretty much.

52:16.424 --> 52:18.385
Why do you think Jin Bu-yeon was here?

52:19.302 --> 52:20.136
I do not know.

52:22.180 --> 52:24.349
Where are you going this time?

52:24.432 --> 52:25.600
I am leaving.

52:25.684 --> 52:27.686
Tell Uk that I do not need the medicine.

52:28.395 --> 52:29.312
Pardon?

52:37.821 --> 52:39.114
Seo Yul really is looking for me.

52:40.115 --> 52:42.450
He is looking for me
even though I ran away on our wedding day?

52:43.493 --> 52:45.704
I am guessing he went against my mother

52:46.204 --> 52:48.290
seeing that he revealed
my face to the world.

52:49.583 --> 52:52.002
It will not be a bad idea
to bet my life on him.

52:55.714 --> 52:57.841
I had no idea you were from Jinyowon.

52:59.426 --> 53:02.262
I apologize for not recognizing you
and calling you a thief.

53:02.846 --> 53:05.682
Everyone is looking for you.
Shall I escort you back to Jinyowon?

53:05.765 --> 53:08.310
First, I would like to meet Seo Yul.

53:09.769 --> 53:11.062
Is he here?

53:11.146 --> 53:13.899
Young Master Seo is…

53:13.982 --> 53:15.567
Let me see if he is in his room.

53:15.650 --> 53:16.610
Please wait.

53:19.195 --> 53:20.572
Let me meet him first.

53:21.740 --> 53:24.367
If he turns out to be all right,
I will choose him.

54:17.253 --> 54:18.380
Does that count

54:20.173 --> 54:21.174
as a wedding drink?

54:32.102 --> 54:36.439
You should never date a man with a past
as painful as a stab to the heart.

54:41.277 --> 54:43.154
A past as painful as a stab to the heart?

54:43.905 --> 54:45.323
He must be in a lot of pain.

54:50.912 --> 54:51.746
Young Lady.

54:51.830 --> 54:52.664
Young Lady.

54:53.331 --> 54:55.542
Young Master Seo is coming right this way.

55:20.150 --> 55:21.276
Everyone is looking for you,

55:22.110 --> 55:25.155
but I never thought
you would come looking for me.

55:25.739 --> 55:28.491
I apologize for running away
on the day of the wedding.

55:28.575 --> 55:31.786
Now that I have met you,
I regret having done that.

55:31.870 --> 55:33.830
If I had met you first,

55:33.913 --> 55:37.375
I would not have hesitated
about getting married.

55:39.169 --> 55:40.879
Why would I have affected your decision?

55:40.962 --> 55:42.547
Because you are handsome.

55:43.965 --> 55:47.427
It is only natural to waver
when one meets a handsome man.

55:50.680 --> 55:52.432
But that is as far as I can go.

55:52.515 --> 55:56.102
Last night, I already gave my heart
to someone else.

55:56.728 --> 55:59.647
I thought I packed all my clothes
and brought everything with me,

55:59.731 --> 56:04.110
but last night's memory still lingers
and will not allow me to move on.

56:08.656 --> 56:10.992
Are you saying you no longer wish to marry

56:12.410 --> 56:13.661
a member of the Seo family?

56:14.788 --> 56:15.622
Yes.

56:15.705 --> 56:19.709
So I would appreciate it
if you would stop the public search.

56:22.420 --> 56:23.254
All right.

56:24.380 --> 56:26.591
I will relay the message to my uncle.

56:30.970 --> 56:32.722
I was not your betrothed.

56:32.806 --> 56:34.516
A man with the surname Seo
from Seoho Fortress.

56:34.599 --> 56:36.893
- You came on a boat.
- I came with my uncle.

56:38.103 --> 56:40.063
I guess you misunderstood
because you did not know his name.

56:40.146 --> 56:41.189
So it was not you?

56:44.317 --> 56:45.485
Thank goodness.

56:45.568 --> 56:47.904
Now it is a lot easier
to give up the marriage.

56:47.987 --> 56:50.949
To be honest,
I was worried that I might regret it.

56:51.699 --> 56:52.617
But now I feel fine.

57:04.295 --> 57:05.213
What is the matter?

57:07.841 --> 57:11.261
Have we ever met before?

57:14.514 --> 57:15.431
That is impossible.

57:16.015 --> 57:17.475
I never went outside.

57:21.855 --> 57:24.399
I need to go. I have three days' worth
of medicine waiting for me.

57:27.527 --> 57:29.112
Please let your uncle know.

57:37.912 --> 57:39.330
It is time to go back, my lady.

57:39.414 --> 57:41.791
Could you just give me a bit more time?

57:41.875 --> 57:42.709
Just three days.

57:43.376 --> 57:46.379
Then I will willingly enter that room

57:46.880 --> 57:49.174
and stay there, just as Mother wants.

57:49.799 --> 57:50.925
Just give me three days.

57:51.009 --> 57:53.178
I am here on Lady Jin's orders.

57:53.887 --> 57:54.721
Come with us.

58:07.275 --> 58:08.401
Was she confined?

58:13.573 --> 58:14.657
Young Master.

58:15.283 --> 58:17.410
Was that lady from Jinyowon?

58:19.746 --> 58:22.248
The entire capital is looking for her.

58:22.999 --> 58:25.710
Maybe that is why, but she suddenly left.

58:26.753 --> 58:27.879
- She left?
- Yes.

58:27.962 --> 58:30.256
She took her wedding dress and everything.

58:30.340 --> 58:32.008
What happened?

58:32.091 --> 58:34.594
What matters is that she is gone.
Forget about yesterday.

58:40.350 --> 58:41.184
I knew it.

58:42.143 --> 58:44.020
Some things are just impossible.

59:11.130 --> 59:12.131
Now that it is broken,

59:13.216 --> 59:14.884
you can go anywhere you want, right?

59:16.177 --> 59:17.971
If you wish to run, I can help.

59:18.054 --> 59:20.181
If you want, I can give you some money.

59:20.265 --> 59:21.891
You promised not to say my name,

59:21.975 --> 59:24.352
so think of it as a settlement.

59:25.937 --> 59:26.938
My mother…

59:28.982 --> 59:30.483
lost me when I was little

59:30.567 --> 59:32.777
and looked for me for over ten years.

59:33.528 --> 59:36.072
I do wish to come out
because it gets suffocating inside,

59:36.155 --> 59:38.116
but I cannot just plainly disappear.

59:39.492 --> 59:40.410
If I do that,

59:42.579 --> 59:44.080
she will lose her daughter again.

59:46.749 --> 59:48.960
And that will kill her inside.

59:54.465 --> 59:55.883
I cannot do that to her.

01:00:00.096 --> 01:00:01.055
I guess she went back

01:00:02.807 --> 01:00:03.808
and got locked up again.

01:00:35.965 --> 01:00:37.216
My precious daughter.

01:00:38.384 --> 01:00:39.761
I thought I lost you again.

01:00:41.346 --> 01:00:42.555
I am sorry, Mother.

01:00:44.390 --> 01:00:45.308
My sweetheart.

01:00:46.517 --> 01:00:47.560
Bu-yeon.

01:00:49.103 --> 01:00:49.937
My daughter.

01:00:55.443 --> 01:00:56.778
You broke off the engagement?

01:00:58.404 --> 01:00:59.822
The Queen is not happy with it.

01:01:01.115 --> 01:01:02.825
I did not think that far ahead.

01:01:02.909 --> 01:01:04.494
Then what will happen to her?

01:01:05.620 --> 01:01:06.454
Why should I care?

01:01:06.537 --> 01:01:09.332
They kept her hidden
because they were embarrassed by her.

01:01:09.415 --> 01:01:11.250
I did them a favor
by offering to marry her.

01:01:12.794 --> 01:01:14.420
But they ruined everything.

01:01:22.011 --> 01:01:23.012
Is it happening again?

01:01:23.096 --> 01:01:25.765
You came to Daeho
because the pain worsened.

01:01:25.848 --> 01:01:27.558
Did you ask Master Heo to treat you?

01:01:33.481 --> 01:01:35.775
Please do not tell anyone
about my condition.

01:01:49.580 --> 01:01:50.998
His Majesty has ordered you

01:01:51.082 --> 01:01:53.668
to bring Jin Bu-yeon
to the Unanimous Assembly.

01:01:56.421 --> 01:01:58.756
Since when did the royal family
give orders to mages

01:01:58.840 --> 01:02:00.341
regarding the Unanimous Assembly?

01:02:01.801 --> 01:02:04.595
Did you advise them to do that
as the Gwanju of Cheonbugwan?

01:02:06.556 --> 01:02:07.890
Just let me meet her.

01:02:09.350 --> 01:02:12.478
I saw a portrait of her,
but I would like to meet her in person.

01:02:13.354 --> 01:02:14.188
Why do you…

01:02:15.940 --> 01:02:17.191
want to see her?

01:02:18.776 --> 01:02:21.028
I am still her uncle.

01:02:21.696 --> 01:02:25.533
It is only natural
that I want to meet my long-lost niece.

01:02:25.616 --> 01:02:26.826
She is a beautiful girl.

01:02:29.328 --> 01:02:30.788
Master Lee tells me

01:02:31.831 --> 01:02:34.417
that she takes after me.

01:02:35.835 --> 01:02:38.129
Master Lee? The pupil of Seo Gyeong?

01:02:38.212 --> 01:02:39.046
Yes.

01:02:39.130 --> 01:02:42.091
When we found Bu-yeon,
she was extremely ill.

01:02:42.175 --> 01:02:44.969
Master Lee treated her

01:02:45.845 --> 01:02:46.804
and looked after her.

01:02:50.308 --> 01:02:51.601
Thanks to you,

01:02:52.351 --> 01:02:54.896
I once humiliated myself
by welcoming a fake daughter.

01:02:54.979 --> 01:02:56.689
I received Master Lee's help

01:02:57.315 --> 01:02:59.066
to prevent that from happening again.

01:03:01.068 --> 01:03:04.489
If he confirmed it for you,
then it must be Bu-yeon without a doubt.

01:03:04.572 --> 01:03:07.658
But why did you keep her hidden?

01:03:07.742 --> 01:03:08.701
I told you she was ill.

01:03:08.785 --> 01:03:09.994
Is she well now?

01:03:12.747 --> 01:03:15.416
The Unanimous Assembly will suggest
that Jinyowon's relics and artifacts

01:03:16.375 --> 01:03:18.544
be moved elsewhere.

01:03:18.628 --> 01:03:21.339
It means the duty to protect Jinyowon
could get passed on

01:03:21.422 --> 01:03:23.466
to a different family.

01:03:23.549 --> 01:03:25.051
That is nonsense.

01:03:25.134 --> 01:03:27.678
This is what happens when you keep
your doors closed for three years.

01:03:28.429 --> 01:03:29.639
The leader of Jinyowon is old,

01:03:29.722 --> 01:03:32.433
which means her power
is weakening day by day.

01:03:32.517 --> 01:03:34.268
Meanwhile, she has no heir
with strong divine powers.

01:03:34.352 --> 01:03:37.396
Why would anyone think it would be safe
to leave the Jin family in charge

01:03:37.480 --> 01:03:39.982
of all those dangerous
and valuable relics and artifacts?

01:03:40.066 --> 01:03:40.900
Is that the advice

01:03:41.776 --> 01:03:45.112
you are giving me
as the Gwanju of Cheonbugwan?

01:03:48.407 --> 01:03:50.576
Here is my advice to you as your brother.

01:03:51.661 --> 01:03:53.871
Bring Bu-yeon to the Unanimous Assembly.

01:03:53.955 --> 01:03:57.124
She is known to have divine powers
as powerful as Jin Seol-ran's.

01:03:58.376 --> 01:04:00.336
If you announce her as your official heir,

01:04:01.963 --> 01:04:04.298
then you will be able to keep Jinyowon.

01:04:10.513 --> 01:04:13.808
All right, then.
I will see you at the Unanimous Assembly.

01:04:36.330 --> 01:04:38.708
Jin Bu-yeon is going to attend
the Unanimous Assembly

01:04:38.791 --> 01:04:40.042
held at Cheonbugwan.

01:04:41.878 --> 01:04:44.297
Jin Bu-yeon has been
the talk of the town for a while now.

01:04:44.922 --> 01:04:46.215
I guess she is finally showing up.

01:04:46.299 --> 01:04:47.758
Would you like to attend?

01:04:47.842 --> 01:04:48.676
No.

01:04:49.385 --> 01:04:51.012
I do not have fond memories of her.

01:04:51.095 --> 01:04:53.639
The last time I went to see her,
I ended up trapped inside a barrier.

01:04:53.723 --> 01:04:54.640
You are right.

01:04:54.724 --> 01:04:55.558
Goodness.

01:04:56.809 --> 01:04:58.311
It was so foggy that I could not see.

01:04:58.394 --> 01:05:00.187
- Right.
- It rained too.

01:05:00.938 --> 01:05:01.772
Gosh.

01:05:09.906 --> 01:05:11.866
I tried to make meju with red beans,

01:05:11.949 --> 01:05:13.242
but I failed.

01:05:14.076 --> 01:05:15.870
So I used it to make red bean porridge.

01:05:16.662 --> 01:05:17.830
How does it taste?

01:05:17.914 --> 01:05:21.125
You say you failed,
but it somehow tastes like meju.

01:05:21.208 --> 01:05:22.668
It does, right?

01:05:22.752 --> 01:05:25.379
I really think
I might be able to turn it into meju.

01:05:25.463 --> 01:05:27.965
Did you invite me to eat
what you failed to make?

01:05:28.049 --> 01:05:28.883
Uk.

01:05:30.801 --> 01:05:33.179
I heard you brought home
someone you wished to marry.

01:05:34.722 --> 01:05:36.682
I figured Maidservant Kim would tell you.

01:05:37.850 --> 01:05:40.770
Why did you kidnap
the priestess of Jinyowon

01:05:41.938 --> 01:05:43.981
on the day of her wedding?

01:05:47.944 --> 01:05:48.778
She was pretty.

01:05:48.861 --> 01:05:51.072
I was mesmerized by her beauty.

01:05:51.155 --> 01:05:52.782
Were you going to ask

01:05:52.865 --> 01:05:55.826
that beautiful woman
to take out the ice stone for you?

01:05:58.245 --> 01:05:59.080
You punk.

01:05:59.163 --> 01:06:02.708
You should marry someone
you wish to spend your life with,

01:06:02.792 --> 01:06:05.169
not someone who will take your life away.

01:06:05.252 --> 01:06:07.254
Do not worry. She ran away.

01:06:07.338 --> 01:06:08.172
Good.

01:06:09.465 --> 01:06:14.261
I heard she is going to be announced
as the official heir of Jinyowon tonight.

01:06:16.097 --> 01:06:17.598
Jin Bu-yeon? How?

01:06:17.682 --> 01:06:20.142
She is a priestess
with great divine powers.

01:06:20.226 --> 01:06:22.853
It seems like there have been concerns
regarding Jinyowon.

01:06:24.897 --> 01:06:27.358
If her eldest daughter attends
the Unanimous Assembly

01:06:27.441 --> 01:06:28.859
and gets announced as the heir,

01:06:30.194 --> 01:06:32.405
Jinyowon will be able to show
that they still stand strong.

01:06:33.280 --> 01:06:35.032
So they are trying to make meju
with red beans.

01:06:39.328 --> 01:06:40.746
Do you know how you can succeed

01:06:41.288 --> 01:06:43.416
in making meju with red beans?

01:06:46.335 --> 01:06:48.796
Is there really a way?

01:06:52.049 --> 01:06:52.925
First, you hide it.

01:06:54.051 --> 01:06:55.803
Then you make sure no one tastes it.

01:06:55.886 --> 01:06:58.764
Does it taste that bad?

01:06:58.848 --> 01:06:59.682
Yes.

01:07:00.891 --> 01:07:01.726
It tastes

01:07:02.810 --> 01:07:03.769
absolutely horrible.

01:07:08.274 --> 01:07:09.567
I will bring you some honey.

01:07:10.484 --> 01:07:12.528
Then it will be sweet red bean porridge.

01:07:25.291 --> 01:07:27.084
Red beans can never turn into meju.

01:07:27.168 --> 01:07:28.044
How foolish of her.

01:07:31.547 --> 01:07:32.757
She should have run away.

01:07:37.470 --> 01:07:39.805
I did not want to take you there,

01:07:39.889 --> 01:07:43.684
but that is the only way
to protect Jinyowon.

01:07:44.685 --> 01:07:45.519
Mother.

01:07:46.520 --> 01:07:47.855
I have no power.

01:07:49.065 --> 01:07:50.191
Will it be all right?

01:07:52.526 --> 01:07:53.360
That is why

01:07:54.862 --> 01:07:55.821
you must help me.

01:07:56.405 --> 01:07:58.824
Bu-yeon, you must never
leave this place again.

01:07:59.784 --> 01:08:03.370
You cannot ever see anyone
now that everyone knows you.

01:08:05.456 --> 01:08:09.210
We cannot let anyone find out
that the heir of Jinyowon

01:08:09.919 --> 01:08:11.629
has no divine powers.

01:08:14.006 --> 01:08:15.382
Then I will have to stay…

01:08:17.593 --> 01:08:19.345
in this room forever.

01:08:23.599 --> 01:08:26.560
Please do it for me.

01:08:33.067 --> 01:08:34.652
Your tracking thread has snapped off.

01:09:00.594 --> 01:09:02.388
Let us tie it so that it can never

01:09:03.389 --> 01:09:04.265
break off again.

01:09:46.849 --> 01:09:47.683
How…

01:09:49.560 --> 01:09:50.519
did that turn off?

01:09:51.103 --> 01:09:54.315
Apparently, I lost my divine powers
along with my memory.

01:09:56.025 --> 01:09:56.901
She clearly told me

01:09:58.611 --> 01:10:00.029
that she could not turn it off.

01:10:21.592 --> 01:10:22.885
I may have deceived you,

01:10:24.053 --> 01:10:25.429
but not everything was a lie.

01:10:39.235 --> 01:10:41.779
Is it true that Jin Bu-yeon has
immense divine powers?

01:10:41.862 --> 01:10:44.823
She found the ice stone, did she not?

01:10:44.907 --> 01:10:47.660
If she really does show up today,

01:10:47.743 --> 01:10:51.372
the Jin family can continue
to be in charge of protecting Jinyowon

01:10:52.039 --> 01:10:53.207
without any concerns.

01:11:07.846 --> 01:11:10.808
After today's assembly, you will go home

01:11:10.891 --> 01:11:12.893
and do as you promised.

01:11:12.977 --> 01:11:17.273
You will never step outside
of Jinyowon ever again.

01:11:34.790 --> 01:11:36.333
Is that Jin Bu-yeon?

01:11:44.591 --> 01:11:46.302
I would like to introduce to you

01:11:46.385 --> 01:11:49.179
the heir of Jinyowon.

01:12:24.840 --> 01:12:26.133
Hello, everyone.

01:12:26.216 --> 01:12:27.926
I am Jin Bu-yeon, the eldest daughter

01:12:29.428 --> 01:12:30.471
of the Jin family.

01:12:55.245 --> 01:12:57.456
- What happened?
- What is going on?

01:12:57.539 --> 01:12:58.499
- What?
- What is it?

01:12:58.582 --> 01:13:00.084
- What is this?
- What is happening?

01:13:52.719 --> 01:13:53.679
Jang Uk?

01:13:53.762 --> 01:13:56.140
What is Jang Uk doing
at the Unanimous Assembly?

01:14:04.606 --> 01:14:06.275
You left without taking your medicine.

01:14:07.025 --> 01:14:08.318
Everyone was looking for me.

01:14:08.402 --> 01:14:10.070
Why are you here?

01:14:10.154 --> 01:14:11.238
To check something.

01:14:15.534 --> 01:14:16.994
This was turned off.

01:14:17.077 --> 01:14:18.036
Did you do it?

01:14:19.997 --> 01:14:21.707
I turned it on again.

01:14:21.790 --> 01:14:23.083
Try turning it off again.

01:14:31.175 --> 01:14:32.009
I…

01:14:34.511 --> 01:14:35.345
do not know how.

01:14:41.059 --> 01:14:42.186
If you turn this off,

01:14:43.228 --> 01:14:44.354
I will take you with me.

01:14:53.947 --> 01:14:54.781
Wait…

01:15:06.293 --> 01:15:07.127
It turned off.

01:15:10.422 --> 01:15:11.256
Did…

01:15:12.508 --> 01:15:13.509
Did I do that?

01:15:40.035 --> 01:15:41.328
What are you doing?

01:15:41.411 --> 01:15:42.246
Jin Bu-yeon…

01:15:44.665 --> 01:15:46.375
cannot become the heir of Jinyowon.

01:15:47.376 --> 01:15:48.752
What do you think you are doing?

01:15:50.879 --> 01:15:51.713
Jin Bu-yeon

01:15:52.673 --> 01:15:54.716
is already married to Jang Uk,
the son of the Jang family.

01:15:56.677 --> 01:15:58.512
- They got married?
- Married?

01:15:58.595 --> 01:16:00.847
- Jin Bu-yeon and Jang Uk?
- What is he saying?

01:16:00.931 --> 01:16:02.891
Bu-yeon, what is this nonsense?

01:16:09.398 --> 01:16:10.524
He is right, Mother.

01:16:12.693 --> 01:16:15.237
This man and I shared a wedding drink

01:16:16.446 --> 01:16:17.656
and became husband and wife.

01:16:19.866 --> 01:16:21.577
I will not return…

01:16:24.204 --> 01:16:25.414
to that room in Jinyowon.

01:16:39.469 --> 01:16:40.887
We are married.

01:16:42.472 --> 01:16:45.142
Please give us your blessings.

01:17:33.774 --> 01:17:36.693
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:17:37.194 --> 01:17:39.071
If my powers can be
considered justification,

01:17:39.154 --> 01:17:41.365
I would like to see you
try arguing with that.

01:17:41.948 --> 01:17:44.409
I was hoping for this.

01:17:45.661 --> 01:17:46.912
Why? What is it?

01:17:46.995 --> 01:17:50.040
I need to find out more about Jin Bu-yeon.

01:17:50.957 --> 01:17:53.335
I think we have been circling
the same path.

01:17:53.960 --> 01:17:55.629
There is nothing wrong
with being airheaded.

01:17:55.712 --> 01:17:56.672
I was simply flustered.

01:17:57.589 --> 01:17:58.965
That looks delicious.

01:17:59.049 --> 01:18:00.467
Eunuch, do you have some money?

01:18:00.550 --> 01:18:02.803
Me? Were you referring to me?

01:18:02.886 --> 01:18:07.641
I shall summon Naksu's soul once again
to distract Jang Uk.

01:18:10.769 --> 01:18:15.774
Subtitle translation by: Joy Lee
